    {
        "header": "3Methodology",
        "images": [
            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.22264/2610.22264v1/GRPO_SCOPE_editable.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Overview of SCOPE Pipeline.The rewriter generates a prompt together with its semantic spans. After removing the span separators, the frozen renderer generates an image whose score contributes to the reward for the completion. SCOPE aligns the spans to rollout tokens and pools changes in log probability between the current and old policies. The resulting coefficients reweight the shared advantage within each span. Gradients flow through the clipped GRPO surrogate while the coefficients are detached.",
                "position": 334
            }
        ]
    },
